WEBVTT

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.268
CA: Thanks, Whitney.

00:02:32.292 --> 00:02:35.601
OK, let's get this moving.

00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:37.518
Our first guest.

00:02:37.542 --> 00:02:41.893
Dr. Phillip Atiba Goff
is the founder and CEO

00:02:41.917 --> 00:02:45.351
of the Center for Policing Equity.

00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:50.184
They work with police departments
across America, including in Minneapolis,

00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:56.059
to seek measurable responses
to racial bias.

00:02:56.083 --> 00:02:58.184
Phil, I can scarcely imagine

00:02:58.208 --> 00:03:01.518
how the stress in the last week
must have been for you.